#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_marin_digest_intelligence
msgid ""
"\n"
"Marin Digest Intelligence\n"
"=========================\n"
"\n"
"Business intelligence digests built on Odoo's ``digest`` framework, with no\n"
"external ML dependency: boolean \"marks\" enable each insight, computed fields\n"
"hold the calculation, and comparisons against earlier periods supply the trend.\n"
"\n"
"Treasury liquidity, the current use case:\n"
"\n"
"* morning digest (8 AM) -- opening balances with historical comparisons\n"
"* afternoon digest (4 PM) -- day activity summary\n"
"* cash and bank accounts detected automatically\n"
"* multi-company, year-over-year comparison\n"
"\n"
"Digests are configured under Settings → Technical → Email → Digests.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
