"Website Sale Product Asset\n"
"==========================\n"
"\n"
"Publishes ``asset_ledger`` assets (vehicles, equipment) as a website catalog\n"
"without online checkout.\n"
"\n"
"* ``product.template.website_quote_only`` -- the product page shows a WhatsApp\n"
"  quote button instead of the add-to-cart flow\n"
"* ``website.whatsapp_sales_number`` -- per-site destination number for the\n"
"  ``wa.me`` link, editable in Website settings\n"
"\n"
"Logic only; MARIN styling lives in ``theme_marin``.\n"
