#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_xiuman
msgid ""
"\n"
"Xiuman\n"
"======\n"
"\n"
"Website theme for xiuman.mx, aligned with Xiuman Brandbook v1.0\n"
"(27 April 2026).\n"
"\n"
"Identity\n"
"--------\n"
"* logotype: bicolor \"X\" symbol (Fertil green, Noche teal-dark) with the custom\n"
"  wordmark, official SVGs from the brand kit\n"
"* colours: Fertil #2EB769, Noche #023E4C, Clorofila #009585, Cielo #1775C9,\n"
"  Rocio #B4D5D6, Mineral #FCF8F2\n"
"* typography: Special Gothic Expanded (display), Archivo Narrow (body), both\n"
"  from Google Fonts\n"
"* corporate pattern: concentric \"X\" line motif\n"
"\n"
"Layout\n"
"------\n"
"* fixed navbar with a mobile slide panel\n"
"* footer with contact info and social links\n"
"* 5 branded pages: Inicio, Nosotros, Productos, Contacto, Gracias\n"
"* scroll-triggered animations (IntersectionObserver)\n"
"* product catalog page with category filtering\n"
"* contact page with a mailto link\n"
"\n"
"Business data is in ``website_xiuman``.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_catalog_xiuman_data
msgid ""
"\n"
"Xiuman Product Catalog (data)\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Data module: installing it creates the **Catálogo Xiuman** with its five\n"
"categories and 43 products, as the printed catalog shows them — the name\n"
"artwork, the active-ingredient lead, the copy, the presentation pictogram and\n"
"the section pictograms.\n"
"\n"
"The content travels in the repository rather than as a file someone copies to\n"
"the server, the same way ``product_docs_xiuman_data`` carries the data sheets:\n"
"a deployment is an install, not a transfer.\n"
"\n"
"The load is idempotent. Entries are matched by section and artwork name, so\n"
"reinstalling updates instead of duplicating. Where a product's label or\n"
"technical data sheet already carries the presentation and the registration\n"
"number, those win over the seed files, which only fill what is missing.\n"
"\n"
"Content as of 2026-09-23. Captive, Tenzole and Metnate are excluded because\n"
"they are the supplier's name for Captacol, Pretecto and Alcento; Deprebac,\n"
"Quick-Quat, Dorquat and Oxamil 240 because they are discontinued; Linexar CT\n"
"because it is not sold yet.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_docs_xiuman_data
msgid ""
"\n"
"Xiuman Product Documents (data)\n"
"===============================\n"
"\n"
"Data module: installing it creates and publishes the **44 Xiuman technical\n"
"data sheets** (``product.technical.sheet``) and **44 safety data sheets**\n"
"(``product.msds``), attaching the branded PDF to every active presentation of\n"
"each product. The content was extracted from APGM's masters (FT XIUMAN,\n"
"Aug 2026; _hds_muestra, Jul 2026).\n"
"\n"
"The loader matches products by database id (every AgroMarin database descends\n"
"from the same origin); a product that does not exist in the target database is\n"
"skipped with a log line, so installing on a partial database is safe. The load\n"
"is idempotent: reinstalling replaces the sheets this module created, matched\n"
"by product name.\n"
"\n"
"Demolition, Omenix and Zomec are deliberately excluded (no active product /\n"
"no stock and no sales — business decision, 2026-08-24).\n"
"\n"
"Since 19.0.1.1.0 the module also loads the **56 Xiuman product labels**\n"
"(``product.label``): the text of every panel extracted from the designer's\n"
"PDFs (``data/labels_data.json``), one label per product name, and the pairing\n"
"of every printed file with its exact SKU (``label_pairing.py``: envase,\n"
"doypack, garrafa, caja). It creates the four SKUs APGM asked for on\n"
"2026-09-07 when they are missing (Syrius XM 720 1L, Tenzole XM 60 1kg, Omenix\n"
"XM 720 1L, Omenix XM 720 1x10L). The 113 cropped PDFs (70 MB) are not in the\n"
"repository: point the ``product_docs_xiuman_data.labels_dir`` system parameter\n"
"(or ``XIUMAN_LABELS_DIR``) at their directory before installing, else the\n"
"labels load without files and each says so in its review notes.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_xiuman
msgid ""
"\n"
"Xiuman Website Data\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"Infrastructure data for xiuman.mx:\n"
"\n"
"* website configuration (homepage, contact button, zero-price guard)\n"
"* public eCommerce categories: Insecticidas, Fungicidas, Bactericidas\n"
"* company and public user assignment through ``post_init_hook``\n"
"\n"
"Holds no product data. The catalog lives in ``marin_data``, and the storefront\n"
"(``theme_xiuman`` /productos) reads published products from their records:\n"
"products are published from each product's eCommerce tab (Website, Is\n"
"Published, Categories, Sales Description, image).\n"
msgstr ""

